### Account balance – happy paths
# Works with the VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Direct to MI by default; switch @base to go through the APIM gateway
# (then fill @token from scripts/apim-demo-consumer.py).
@mi = http://localhost:8290
@gw = https://localhost:8243/jamii
@base = {{mi}}/accounts
# @base = {{gw}}/accounts/v1
@token = paste-oauth2-access-token

### ACTIVE account, KES (expect 200)
GET {{base}}/0100000001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-acc-0001

### DORMANT account (expect 200, status DORMANT)
GET {{base}}/0100000003/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CLOSED account with zero balance (expect 200, amount 0.00)
GET {{base}}/0100000004/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### USD account (expect 200, currency USD)
GET {{base}}/0100000006/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
